  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (43.3545 43.3545 43.3545)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  1685 bonds
  reading angles ...
  3060 angles
  reading dihedrals ...
  4790 dihedrals
